{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23850","headline":"同崔十八寄元浙东王陕州 · 白居易","name":"同崔十八寄元浙东王陕州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未能同隐云林下，且复相招禄仕间。\n随月有钱胜卖药，终年无事抵归山。\n镜湖水远何由泛，棠树枝高不易攀。\n惆怅八科残四在，两人荣闹两人闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}